From 226fec0a20b493d318b3b2558dadb12b213ce132 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 08:49:33 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 043/126] clashapi: a failed listen of the external controller
 does not fail the start

The Clash API carries no traffic, yet a failed listen of external_controller
(the address taken by another program, or an address not on an interface yet
while the router boots) failed the whole start. On OpenWrt procd restarts a
failed service a few times and then gives up, and podkop's failsafe stops on
that: the proxy went down for the sake of its dashboard. The error is logged
and the listen retried in the background, 5 s at first, doubling up to a
minute, until it succeeds or the server closes.
---
